# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# Biome's formatter requires LF. Without this file, a contributor with
# `core.autocrlf=true` (the Git for Windows default) gets CRLF working copies of
# files that are stored as LF, and `pnpm lint` fails with format errors on files
# they never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files — never convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary
*.node binary
